warning[zero_ptr]: `cast(*Node) 0` is a null pointer
  --> tests/lint/zero_ptr/bad.jai:7:17
   |
 7 | global: *Node = cast(*Node) 0;
   |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `null`
   |
 7 ~ global: *Node = null;
   |
   = note: `zero_ptr` is `warn` by default

